Revision history for Alien-ckdl

0.002  2026-10-15
        - Deprecated. Text::KDL::XS 0.003 and later bundle the ckdl sources
          and compile them into the module, so nothing depends on this
          Alien any more. This final release marks the distribution as
          deprecated (x_deprecated in the metadata, a notice in the POD
          and at configure time) and builds the same ckdl commit as
          0.001, so Text::KDL::XS 0.001 and 0.002 stay installable.
          There will be no further releases.

0.001  2026-04-30
        - Initial CPAN release.
        - Builds ckdl from upstream main as a static library via alienfile.
        - Bypasses upstream CMake; only the C sources making up libkdl
          are compiled (no Python, Cython, C++ bindings, or test suite).
